https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-c9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reading families in the library read model[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]family[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]family: teach ref_library the note-local earlier: list, reading numbers,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and families. Doctor stops flagging families as duplicate_identity, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]find/show/resolve rank the newest reading first, list/show render vN [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips and earlier/later rows, and JSON grows additively; uses [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hand-written fixtures only.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One already-captured refusal, before parent resolution[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refusal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refusal: route every duplicate site (URL dedupe, same-reference stem [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk, library PDF as TARGET, collections) through one renderer that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lists every copy and prints several hint rows. Duplicate detection runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before the missing -P error. -f semantics are unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The --force[=MODE] parser and bare -f reread[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]reread[dim] · [dim][/dim]after family, refusal[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reread: turn -f into --force[=MODE], with adjacent-mode adoption and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stray-mode guard, and replace the bool with Option<ForceMode>. Ship [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reread end to end: the <root>__vN allocator, earlier: written at birth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [